<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Manpower cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Manpower cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities has cut its rating on Manpower Inc to hold from buy, a source at the brokerage said Friday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Milwaukee temporary employment company closed Thursday at 48-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
